-- Deepen the core subjects: a 3rd, prerequisite-ordered sub-topic per
-- subject/grade with grade-appropriate questions. Run once. Safe to re-run
-- (fixed ids + on conflict). Enables meaningful soft gating (order_index 3).

on conflict (id) do update set sub_topic = excluded.sub_topic, order_index = excluded.order_index;

on conflict (id) do nothing;
